!Series_summary = To determine if EP400 knockdown would affect Max target genes in Merkel cell carcinoma cell line MKL-1, we performed RNA-seq analyses of MKL-1 cells inducibly expressing EP400 shRNA and compared to ChIP-seq data using BETA analyses.
